# pull requests now group per pull request. This implements the ratified topic
# a-newer-push-to-a-pull-request-cancels-the-ci-run-of-the-head-it (row 5c).
#
# Tier: MAINTAINER. It modifies existing workflow lines (the group expression and
# cancel-in-progress) and runs less CI (replaced PR heads only); the newest head of
# every pull request still runs the full aggregate, so no gate is removed from any
# head that can merge.
